Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}In this simplified E D A model, each node represents a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}在这个简化的电子设计自动化模型中，每个节点代表一个电路单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:10.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}An edge weight describes connectivity: a larger weight means a stronger connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:10.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}边权表示连接强度：权重越大，连接越强。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}A node also has a size, which can represent cell area rather than node count.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}节点还有大小属性，可以代表单元面积，而不只是节点个数。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:21.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Here every node has size one, so cluster size equals its number of members.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:21.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}这里每个节点的大小都是一，因此簇大小等于成员个数。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:27.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Real netlists may use hypergraphs; this lab deliberately uses an undirected weighted graph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:27.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}真实网表可能使用超图；本实验特意采用无向加权图。
